opyright:"All rights reserved.",heroTitle1:"High Quality",heroTitle2:"Coatings & Additives",heroTitle3:"Solutions for Industry",industriesLabel:"Industries & Services",industriesTitle1:"Serving Various",industriesTitle2:"Industry Sectors",industriesDesc:"We provide high-quality coating and component solutions for various industrial needs.",industryConstruction:"Construction",industryPrintingPackaging:"Printing & Packaging",industryPlasticCoating:"Plastic Coating",industryMetalCoating:"Metal Coating",industryWoodCoating:"Wood Coating",industryAdditives:"Additives",isoBannerTitle:"Committed to International Standards",isoBannerDesc:"Our operations are certified under ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 14001:2015, ensuring quality, environmental responsibility, and safety in every product.",viewISO:"View ISO Certification",aboutPageLabel:"Company Profile",aboutPageTitle:"Get to Know PT Alkindo Mitraraya",aboutPageDesc:"PT Alkindo Mitraraya is a trusted source of premium resin and polymer solutions for global industrial challenges. Driven by “Delivering Quality and Innovation”, we create value through innovation, technology integration, world-class quality standards, and strong sustainability commitment.",aboutSectionTitle:"Dedication to High-Performance Polymers",aboutParagraph1:"Since our founding, PT Alkindo Mitraraya has been committed to providing premium protective coating products based on advanced polymer technology. We serve diverse industries from manufacturing and pharmaceuticals to maritime infrastructure across Indonesia.",aboutParagraph2:"Each product is designed through rigorous lab research to ensure maximum resistance against corrosion, extreme chemical spills, and physical abrasion.",contactSectionLabel:"Contact Us",contactSectionTitle:"Ready to Discuss?",contactSectionSubtitle:"Our team is ready to help with your industrial coating and chemical needs. Contact us for a free consultation.",contactInfoAddress:"Jl. Jend Gatot Subroto KM. 8, Kadu Jaya, Tangerang, Kabupaten Tangerang, Banten 15810",contactInfoPhone:"+62 xxx xxxx xxxx",contactInfoEmail:"admin@alkindo.com",whatsappChat:"Chat via WhatsApp",contactFormFullName:"Full Name",contactFormCompany:"Company",contactFormEmail:"Email",contactFormPhone:"Phone",contactFormProductInterest:"Product Interest",contactFormMessage:"Message",contactFormPlaceholderName:"Your Name",contactFormPlaceholderCompany:"Company name",contactFormPlaceholderEmail:"email@company.com",contactFormPlaceholderPhone:"+62 xxx xxxx",contactFormPlaceholderMessage:"Tell us about your coating or product needs...",contactButtonSend:"Send Message",contactButtonRedirecting:"Redirecting...",contactFormEmailHelp:"Please use your business email address (e.g. name@company.com)",contactFormErrorBusinessEmail:"Please use a business email address, not Gmail/Yahoo/Outlook.",contactToastRedirectTitle:"Redirecting to WhatsApp...",contactToastRedirectDesc:"Please send the pre-filled message in your chat app.",productsSectionLabel:"Our Products",productsSectionTitle:"Premium Polymer Solutions",productsSectionSubtitle:"Comprehensive range of high-quality polymer products engineered for performance across diverse industrial applications.",productsSectionCta:"Request Product Catalog",companyStatsLabel:"Operational Scale",companyStatsTitle:"Capabilities & Operational Scale",companyStatsDesc:"Our production capacity and distribution network ensure your coating requirements are met with consistency and premium quality.",statsCapacityLabel:"Manufacturing Capacity",statsCapacityUnit:"Ton / Year",statsReachLabel:"Distribution Reach",statsReachUnit:"Regional Countries",statsClientsLabel:"Active Partnerships",statsClientsUnit:"Corporate Clients",statsQcLabel:"Formulation Standards",statsQcUnit:"QC Pass",faqLabel:"Frequently Asked Questions",faqTitle:"Common Questions",faqDesc:"Find answers to common questions about our products, services, and processes. Can't find what you're looking for? Contact us directly.",faqStillQuestions:"Still have questions?",faqContactLink:"Contact our team for more information",faqQuestion1:"Do you offer custom chemical formulation services?",faqAnswer1:"Yes, our R&D team specializes in developing custom chemical formulations tailored to your specific requirements. We work closely with clients to understand their needs and create solutions that meet exact performance specifications, regulatory requirements, and budget constraints.",faqQuestion2:"What is your Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)?",faqAnswer2:"Our MOQ varies depending on the product type and formulation complexity. For standard products, we typically start from 200 liters, while custom formulations may have different requirements. Contact our sales team to discuss your specific needs and get a customized quote.",faqQuestion3:"Can you provide TDS and MSDS documents?",faqAnswer3:"Absolutely. We provide comprehensive Technical Data Sheets (TDS) and Material Safety Data Sheets (MSDS) for all our products. These documents include detailed information about chemical composition, handling procedures, safety precautions, and regulatory compliance data.",faqQuestion4:"How do you ensure chemical logistics safety?",faqAnswer4:"We follow strict safety protocols for chemical storage, handling, and transportation. Our logistics partners are certified for hazardous material transport, and we provide proper packaging, labeling, and documentation to ensure safe delivery. We also offer guidance on proper storage and handling at your facility.",labShowcaseLabel:"Research & Development",labShowcaseTitle:"Innovation at Our Core",labShowcaseDesc:"Our dedicated R&D team combines scientific expertise with cutting-edge technology to deliver superior chemical solutions that drive your business forward.",labCapability1Title:"Custom Formulation",labCapability1Desc:"Our expert chemists develop tailored chemical solutions to meet your specific industrial requirements and performance specifications.",labCapability2Title:"Rigorous QC Testing"